@title Drive hoist slow-down switch: the hook slows before the final upper limit and the run reports the speed at the limit (1366x768)
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768
# Opens the limits variant of the drive hoist fixture (slow-down switch at 0.8 m, final limit at
# 1.1 m, both drawn as normally closed contacts), starts Simulate > Drive run, switches Live on and
# lifts with radio step 2 until the final limit stops the hoist.
open qa/fixtures/hoist-drive-limits.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
click_text "Switch on Live"
wait 20
click_text "Start"
wait 20
key Home
wait 30
mouse_down 123 343
wait 150
shot lifting
wait 1800
expect "slow-down switch"
expect "final limit"
expect "What the hoist run found"
check_layout
shot slowed-before-the-final-limit
mouse_up 123 343
wait 300
shot stopped
